      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's break down this hilarious misunderstanding line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Костя, зачем ты ему сказал?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kostya, why did you tell him?' Furious accusations of betrayal fly across the room.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Мне же теперь полный конец.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am completely finished now.' Max laments that his life is essentially over because of this leak.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Кому я сказал?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who did I tell?' Genuine confusion meets the wild claims of revealing sensitive secrets.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Тому мужику в костюме.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That man in the suit.' The sharply dressed interrogator is finally identified as the recipient of the information.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Чего он у тебя спрашивал?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What was he asking you?' Demanding to know the exact contents of that conversation is the only next step.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Да успокойся ты наконец.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, calm down already.' Kostya tells his panicked friend to take a deep breath and relax.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Он просто спрашивал про туалет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He was simply asking about the restroom.' Revealing the incredibly mundane topic of their brief interaction defuses the tension.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Серьёзно?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Seriously?' Staring in disbelief, the terrified worker hopes this is not a cruel joke.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Только про туалет?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Only about the restroom?' Max asks for reassurance that the conversation went no further than plumbing.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Да, он искал туалет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, he was looking for the restroom.' Kostya confirms the stranger only wanted directions to the facilities.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А про меня не спрашивал?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And he didn't ask about me?' Checking one last time ensures that no personal names were ever mentioned.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Кому ты вообще нужен?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who needs you anyway?' Kostya dismisses the concern and asks who would even care about him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Слава богу, пронесло.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank goodness, dodged a bullet.' Max breathes a massive sigh of relief at narrowly avoiding disaster.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
